sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as User
    participant Gateway as API Gateway
    participant Service as Request-owning service
    participant Authority as Authority service
    participant Store as Local PostgreSQL and outbox
    participant Broker as RabbitMQ
    participant Consumer as Idempotent consumer

    User->>Gateway: Authenticated HTTPS request
    Gateway->>Gateway: Validate token and route authorization
    Gateway->>Service: Forward versioned REST request

    opt Current authority is required to finish the request
        Service->>Authority: Resilient REST lookup with timeout
        Authority-->>Service: Current decision or controlled failure
    end

    Service->>Store: Commit aggregate change and outbox event atomically
    Store-->>Service: Local transaction committed
    Service-->>Gateway: API response envelope
    Gateway-->>User: Status, data and correlation ID

    loop Outbox dispatcher
        Service->>Store: Lock pending outbox record
        Service->>Broker: Publish versioned integration event
        Broker-->>Service: Publisher confirmation
        Service->>Store: Mark event as published
    end

    Broker-->>Consumer: Deliver event from durable queue
    Consumer->>Store: Check event ID and payload fingerprint

    alt Exact duplicate
        Store-->>Consumer: Existing receipt found
        Consumer-->>Broker: Acknowledge without a second mutation
    else New valid event
        Consumer->>Store: Apply state change and save receipt
        Store-->>Consumer: Local transaction committed
        Consumer-->>Broker: Acknowledge after local commit
    else Invalid or transient failure
        Consumer--xBroker: Reject or retry with bounded attempts
        Broker-->>Broker: Route exhausted messages to the service DLQ
    end
